# nemotron-3.5-bolt — NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt 74B-A9B: a heterogeneous
# ("Puzzle") Mamba-2 + attention mixture of experts (74B total, 9B active, top-9
# routing), distilled from the Super-VL-120B parent (Star-Elastic NAS) down to a
# ~24 GB footprint. Thinking and tool calls, up to a 262144-token window. It is
# also vision-language (image + video in) — but the Mac/llama.cpp vision path is
# unproven (see mac.env), so ROLES here lists only the text roles true on every
# platform; add "vision" when a platform is confirmed to serve the mmproj.
# What every platform shares. NVIDIA OpenMDW-1.1, not gated
# (nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-24GB, released 2026-10-15, checked 2026-10-15).
MODEL=nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-24GB
ROLES="chat tools reasoning code"

# --- 5 DIALECT: what a client must do for correct answers (the app reads these)
# Thinking is on by default; a request turns it off.
DIALECT_THINKING=chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking
# The card's sampling.
DIALECT_SAMPLING="temperature=1.0 top_p=0.95"
